{"id":"n59725-2-7","stage":0,"title":"부자 · 富翁","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59725-2-7-1","ko":"우리는 형제가 딸만 다섯이야.","zh":"我们是姐妹五个。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리는","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"형제가","meaning":"兄弟姐妹；本句指五个姐妹","explanation":"형제：兄弟姐妹；本句指五个姐妹；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"형제","audio":"/audio/6d2b6b10fa368657dc32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73223","senseId":"2","lemma":"형제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"딸만","meaning":"女儿","explanation":"딸：女儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"딸","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30210","senseId":"1","lemma":"딸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다섯이야.","meaning":"五","explanation":"다섯：五；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58111","senseId":"1","lemma":"다섯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"6d2b6b10fa368657","term":"형제","zh":"兄弟姐妹；本句指五个姐妹","audio":"/audio/6d2b6b10fa368657dc32.mp3","entryId":"73223","definition":"兄弟姐妹；本句指五个姐妹","pronunciation":["형제"]},{"id":"11cf51a3ca8b5108","term":"딸","zh":"女儿","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3","entryId":"30210","definition":"由父母所生的子女中的女性；女性孩子。","pronunciation":["딸"]},{"id":"0d616c5afd4feb13","term":"다섯","zh":"五","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3","entryId":"58111","definition":"四加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["다섣"]}],"audio":"/audio/902e25d12327a8e09b72.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59725-2-7-2","ko":"우와. 부모님께서 딸 부자시네.","zh":"哇，你爸妈真是有好多女儿啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本